      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m sending a dirty draft of reworking CBI SSFC support to work through driver API and let the device drivers (motion_sensors in this case) decide what to do with alternative devices. Doing it this way would support SSFC not only motion_sensors, but every possible device e.g. usb_ss_mux version as it is in dedede. Obviously, this code is not ready for review, but I want to ask you if the direction is good in your opinion. ",
      "revId": "d6b66ddecd54a03ef99553cf950bf2677f3449a3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
